dnpvDztMNTSPrRm4TPMJfFMNjqJPw61PgA9-ikXRoJPXaOlQUD4rs5aD-8F6XXBjHA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxZ2mCFrkkxG1si5YZVR1xi9oZ-0Zvo2KQMcKhdmIqgqw&oe=69AEB56D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Pro Forklift Simulator Extreme VR", "keywords": ["ForkliftSimulator", "ForkliftExtremeSimulator", "ForklifDriver", "ForkliftDrivingSimulator"], "long_description": "Step into the ultimate VR forklift experience with Pro Forklift Simulator Extreme VR!\nWhether you\u2019re a professional looking to sharpen your skills or a VR enthusiast craving realistic machinery gameplay, this simulator delivers immersive, hands-on forklift operation like never before.\nRealistic Controls & Physics: Feel the weight and precision of operating a real forklift. Use authentic controls to lift, stack, and transport pallets through a fully detailed warehouse environment.\nChallenging Missions: Complete a variety of tasks, from delicate pallet stacking to fast-paced loading challenges. Each mission tests your accuracy, timing, and planning skills.\nMultiple Forklift Types: Choose from different forklift models, including counterbalance, reach trucks, and pallet jacks, each with unique handling characteristics.\nImmersive VR Environment: Designed exclusively for VR headsets like Meta Quest, enjoy 360-degree interaction with realistic sound effects and detailed warehouse layouts.\nSkill Progression: Improve your forklift operation skills as you unlock new levels, harder challenges, and performance achievements.\nSafety & Training: Perfect for aspiring forklift operators or warehouse professionals seeking a risk-free training environment. Learn proper forklift techniques in a virtual space.\nWhether you want professional training or just some fun lifting and stacking, Pro Forklift Simulator Extreme VR delivers a realistic and engaging experience that puts you in the driver\u2019s s", "short_description": "Experience realistic forklift operations in immersive VR. Master challenging warehouse tasks and become a pro operator!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/horizonhub-privacypolicy/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Horizon Hub", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/horizonhubcom/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "24487317597528974"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 8, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1479471356874917"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1195859405608446"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1919389828936285"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2006831590112002"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1546300676784682"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1210692671099992"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1122210209799649"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1705021433782950"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1705021433782950"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1776445200, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1479471356874917"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "24503566379237429", "version": "1.0"}, "id": "543766645489835", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "prima